From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:35:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/18] ovn: enable egress firewall

enable-egress-firewall=true, the EgressFirewall CRD in MicroShift's CRD
list so it exists before OVN-K starts, and the cluster manager's right to
patch its status. Upstream ships the flag off and no CRD, so no
k8s.ovn.org kind is served; dotvirt treats EgressFirewall as a tenant
kind, as on OpenShift.

The CRD file is not carried: the SRPM stage writes
assets/crd/egressfirewall.crd.yaml from the payload's
cluster-network-operator (src/image/payload-crds.sh), so it always matches
the OVN-K that ships with it. Single-node ovnkube runs with the admin
kubeconfig; the zones node role already carries OpenShift's reads.

CIDRs and DNS names work, names through ovnkube's own resolver. Wildcard
names need DNSNameResolver, off here as in OpenShift 5.0's default
(TechPreviewNoUpgrade only).

Upstream: no config knob as of 5.0.
Covered by: vm-test (an EgressFirewall Deny cuts a pod off a node address,
other namespaces keep it, its removal restores it).
---
 assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml | 7 +++++++
 assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml              | 2 +-
 pkg/assets/crd.go                                        | 1 +
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml b/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
index 323394004c7077593cb33a8f9d6c889c497434e5..8aaa4e18682cacd85e3abbbcca12f768906df4af 100644
--- a/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
+++ b/assets/components/ovn/common/clusterrole-controller.yaml
@@ -170,3 +170,10 @@ rules:
   - baselineadminnetworkpolicies/status
   verbs:
   - patch
+# enable-egress-firewall: zone controllers write each EgressFirewall's status
+# and the cluster manager clears stale zone entries from it, as with ANP.
+- apiGroups: ["k8s.ovn.org"]
+  resources:
+  - egressfirewalls/status
+  verbs:
+  - patch
diff --git a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
index b9d6899434ee0e7e541e6695df30ef22668be72e..0c7a9334f3ab2cca71f359b0d0b524d3301963ed 100644
--- a/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
+++ b/assets/components/ovn/common/configmap.yaml
@@ -27,7 +27,7 @@ data:
 
     [ovnkubernetesfeature]
     enable-egress-ip=false
-    enable-egress-firewall=false
+    enable-egress-firewall=true
     enable-egress-qos=false
     enable-multi-network=true
     enable-multi-networkpolicy=true
diff --git a/pkg/assets/crd.go b/pkg/assets/crd.go
index ec21e1c12ea26936d2e732cf51c51fd4a38b847d..29b5c1f377617d0b9813cf7c90b1f678f2c5314e 100644
--- a/pkg/assets/crd.go
+++ b/pkg/assets/crd.go
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@ var (
 		"crd/multi-networkpolicy.crd.yaml",
 		"crd/admin-network-policy.crd.yaml",
 		"crd/baseline-admin-network-policy.crd.yaml",
+		"crd/egressfirewall.crd.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/topolvm.io_logicalvolumes.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/lvm.topolvm.io_lvmclusters.yaml",
 		"components/lvms/lvm.topolvm.io_lvmvolumegroupnodestatuses.yaml",
